        <th class="sep">Güncel</th><th>RSI</th><th>MACD</th>
        <th class="sep">Destek</th><th>Direnç</th><th>Des.1y</th><th>Dir.1y</th>
        <th class="sep">BB Alt</th><th>BB Üst</th>
        <th class="sep">Alış Al.</th><th>Satış Al.</th><th>Stop</th><th>Stop%</th>
        <th class="sep"></th>
        <th class="sep">Sinyal</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody id="tb"></tbody>
  </table></div>
  <div class="legend">
    <span>RSI: <span style="color:#A32D2D">&gt;70</span> aşırı alım · <span style="color:#0F6E56">&lt;35</span> aşırı satım</span>
    <span>Stop%: mevcut fiyattan stop-loss'a mesafe</span>
    <span>Des/Dir 1y: 52 haftalık destek/direnç</span>
  </div>
</div>

